config ROSE_PROTOCOL
	bool "RoSE co-simulation protocol/transport layer"
	default y
	depends on ROSE
	help
	  Transport-neutral RoSE packet protocol layer (request/response framing,
	  command set) on top of the RoSE adapter driver. Used by higher-level
	  shims (rose-i2c bus, rose sensor drivers) so the same user-facing API
	  works in co-sim or on real hardware.
